00:12:31,578 --> 00:12:37,578
Mr. Jones is a thriller, drama, history film directed by Agnieszka Holland.

3
00:18:47,368 --> 00:18:53,368
In 1933, Welsh journalist Gareth Jones travels to Ukraine,
where he experiences the horrors of a famine.

4
00:25:03,157 --> 00:25:09,157
Everywhere he goes he meets henchmen of the Soviet secret service who are
determined to prevent news about the catastrophe from getting out.

5
00:31:18,947 --> 00:31:24,947
Stalin’s forced collectivisation of agriculture has resulted in
misery and ruin—the policy is tantamount to mass murder.

6
